.TH QUIPU-PROPOSE-SUBMIT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-propose\-submit \- Submit a schema change proposal
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu propose submit\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-proposer\fR] [\fB\-\-rationale\fR] [\fB\-\-trigger\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIkind\fR> <\fItarget\fR> <\fIdiff\-file\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Submit a schema change proposal
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-proposer\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Identity proposing an alignment
.TP
\fB\-\-rationale\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Reason for the alignment decision
.TP
\fB\-\-trigger\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Trigger identifier
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIkind\fR>

.TP
<\fItarget\fR>

.TP
<\fIdiff\-file\fR>

